# shortcutpad config — one entry per line: Name | keyword | url
# A url containing %s or {query} becomes a site-search engine (usable from the omnibox).
# A plain url becomes a bookmark.
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored.

GitHub          | gh    | https://github.com/search?q=%s
Google          | g     | https://www.google.com/search?q=%s
DuckDuckGo      | d     | https://duckduckgo.com/?q=%s
Wikipedia       | w     | https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=%s
YouTube         | yt    | https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=%s
Hacker News     | hn    | https://hn.algolia.com/?q=%s
MDN             | mdn   | https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/search?q=%s
Stack Overflow  | so    | https://stackoverflow.com/search?q=%s
Reddit          | r     | https://www.reddit.com/search/?q=%s
Sourcegraph     | sg    | https://sourcegraph.com/search?q=%s
NPM             | npm   | https://www.npmjs.com/search?q=%s
GitHub Home     | ghh   | https://github.com
